    "detailed_description": "Well, you know what it is - to play hockey. A split of second to lift up your eyes and make a decision, splashes of ice into your face, feeling of flight and a great speed... Here it is - welcome! First person mode gives you a full sense of presense, realistic physical puck and only a short moment to escape the colision! You can invite friends, build a team and play online, or try your luck and play alone offline with an AI partner against exstra smart AI guys. <br />\r\nHot Ice was conceived and developed as an alternative to regular classic hockey simulators - presenting you a feeling and comfort of a spectator. You will find nothing of this kind in Hot Ice!) It's overhelmingly swift, tough and live. You control your player and drive the puck with a mouse - giving it the desired velociy and direction - lift it or let it go low, pass it to your partner or shoot. <br />\r\nYou can push, escape collisions by jumping or catch and tumble someone trying to push you.<br />\r\nWe hope you will enjoy our game and have a real fun and a nice time with friends.",
